      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white px-6 py-8 max-lg:px-6 max-sm:px-4 opacity-0" id="content"><section data-section-type="activity_open_ended_answer" data-section-id="pg105_sec001" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="mb-8"><div class="flex items-stretch max-sm:block"><div class="flex-1 bg-purple-500 px-6 py-4 text-white"><h1 class="adt-h1 font-bold" data-id="pg105_n0002">Resurset dhe trash&#xeb;gimia e vendit tim</h1></div><div class="w-36 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center max-sm:mt-3 max-sm:w-full max-sm:py-4"><div class="text-white text-5xl leading-none" aria-hidden="true">&#x273e;</div></div></div><div class="mt-5 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0"><h2 class="adt-h2 text-gray-900" data-id="pg105_n0004">Kujdesi sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor</h2><div class="mt-2 h-1 w-96 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-48"></div></div></div><div class="mb-10 ml-4 mr-0 max-sm:ml-0"><div class="flex overflow-hidden rounded-none bg-purple-100 border border-purple-100 max-sm:block"><div class="flex-1 p-5"><ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-800"><li class="flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">&#x2013;</span><span data-id="pg105_n0008">Pse Mali &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i zbeht&#xeb; dhe nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span></li><li class="flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">&#x2013;</span><span data-id="pg105_n0010">&#xc7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span></li><li class="flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">&#x2013;</span><span><span data-id="pg105_n0012">Cili &#xeb;sht&#xeb; ushqimi yt m&#xeb; i p&#xeb;lqyer?</span> <span data-id="pg105_n0013">A mendon se &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m?</span> <span data-id="pg105_n0014">Pse?</span></span></li><li class="flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">&#x2013;</span><span data-id="pg105_n0016">Si mund ta p&#xeb;rmir&#xeb;sosh t&#xeb; ushqyerit t&#xeb;nd?</span></li><li class="flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">&#x2013;</span><span data-id="pg105_n0018">Sa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m sporti p&#xeb;r ty?</span></li></ul></div><div class="w-28 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-6xl leading-none max-sm:w-full max-sm:h-24" aria-hidden="true">?</div></div></div><div class="mb-8 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0"><p class="adt-body mb-1 text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg105_n0020">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin.</span></p><p class="adt-body text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg105_n0021">Tregoji atij se &#xe7;far&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qen&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m.</span></p></div><div class="mb-10 ml-4 max-sm:ml-0"><div class="border-2 border-green-400 p-3 max-sm:p-2"><div class="space-y-4"><div><span class="sr-only" data-id="pg105_n0022"></span><label for="activity-item-1" class="sr-only">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 1</label><input id="activity-item-1" data-activity-item="item-1" type="text" aria-label="Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 1" class="min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0"></div><div><span class="sr-only" data-id="pg105_n0023"></span><label for="activity-item-2" class="sr-only">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 2</label><input id="activity-item-2" data-activity-item="item-2" type="text" aria-label="Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 2" class="min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0"></div><div><span class="sr-only" data-id="pg105_n0024"></span><label for="activity-item-3" class="sr-only">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 3</label><input id="activity-item-3" data-activity-item="item-3" type="text" aria-label="Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 3" class="min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0"></div><div><span class="sr-only" data-id="pg105_n0025"></span><label for="activity-item-4" class="sr-only">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 4</label><input id="activity-item-4" data-activity-item="item-4" type="text" aria-label="Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 4" class="min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0"></div><div><span class="sr-only" data-id="pg105_n0026"></span><label for="activity-item-5" class="sr-only">Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 5</label><input id="activity-item-5" data-activity-item="item-5" type="text" aria-label="Shkruaj nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;shill&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Malin, rreshti 5" class="min-h-11 w-full border-0 border-b-2 border-green-400 bg-transparent px-2 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-0"></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-10 ml-2 mr-2 border border-purple-400 max-sm:mx-0"><div class="flex items-start max-sm:block"><div class="flex-1 p-3 pr-4 italic text-gray-800"><p class="mb-3"><span data-id="pg105_n0029">Ruajtja e sh&#xeb;ndetit b&#xeb;het vet&#xeb;m me kujdes t&#xeb; vazhduesh&#xeb;m.</span> <span data-id="pg105_n0030">Kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; mir&#xeb;mbajtja ose p&#xeb;rmir&#xeb;simi i sh&#xeb;ndetit ton&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg105_n0031">P&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme, duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r higjien&#xeb;n personale, t&#xeb; marrim ushqime t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme, t&#xeb; merremi me aktivitete fizike, me sporte t&#xeb; ndryshme dhe t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; sh&#xeb;titje n&#xeb; aj&#xeb;r t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, pasi t&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to forcojn&#xeb; trupin dhe mendjen.</span></p><p class="mb-3"><span data-id="pg105_n0033">Q&#xeb; t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; aft&#xeb; t&#xeb; kryejm&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha aktivitetet ditore, duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; s&#xeb; paku tet&#xeb; or&#xeb; gjum&#xeb; gjat&#xeb; nat&#xeb;s.</span></p><p class="mb-3"><span data-id="pg105_n0035">Duhen b&#xeb;r&#xeb; vizita t&#xeb; vazhdueshme te stomatologu dhe te mjeku i familjes.</span></p><p><span data-id="pg105_n0037">Shprehit&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kujdesin sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor krijohen qysh n&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ri t&#xeb; hershme dhe zbatohen gjat&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jet&#xeb;s.</span></p></div><div class="w-44 bg-purple-500 flex items-start justify-center p-3 text-white text-5xl leading-none max-sm:w-full max-sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">&#x1f4d6;</div></div></div><div class="ml-4 max-sm:ml-0 adt-body text-gray-900"><span class="font-bold" data-id="pg105_n0039">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id="pg105_n0040">kujdes sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor, higjien&#xeb;, sport, ushqim i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m, vizit&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;sore.</span></div></section></div>
